{
  "__doc__": [
    "PENDING curated cases for ceo-performance-award::Eligible-Service-Requirement (ledger #8).",
    "This file is intentionally NOT named `.cases.json` so the parity harness does",
    "NOT auto-load it: the function currently REFUSES on the WASM backend",
    "(supported:false), so a live curated cell would produce zero real comparisons",
    "and trip the harness's partial-corpus-collapse guard (parity-harness.mjs:503).",
    "When the two backend gaps below are fixed, rename this file to",
    "`ceo-performance-award.cases.json` to gate the fix.",
    "",
    "Gaps that must land first (see specs/todo/mlir-parity-fixes.md ledger #8):",
    "  (1) DEONTIC contract extraction (Schema.hs exprToGuard) must represent an",
    "      IF guard that is a helper-call application, e.g. `Forfeiture Applies` s;",
    "      today it returns Nothing so extractDeonticContract bails and the export",
    "      refuses at schema-build time.",
    "  (2) PROVIDED guards on an action (deontonToContract drops action.provided)",
    "      and EXACTLY action arguments must be captured, else interpretation is",
    "      silently wrong.",
    "",
    "Reference note on event-replay cases: fulfilled / breach-by-deadline /",
    "wrong-action sequences for THIS contract require fielded actions such as",
    "`maintain eligible service status` <Service Status>, `vest immediately`",
    "<Reason>, `forfeit unvested shares` <Reason>. jl4-service's own events codegen",
    "(jl4-service/src/Backend/CodeGen.hs:431 fnLiteralToL4ExprWithType) renders a",
    "fielded action as `Award Action` WITH <ctor> IS ... — which is a type error for",
    "a sum-type-with-fields constructor — so those sequences cannot currently be",
    "encoded even against the reference. The cases below therefore use empty event",
    "streams, which return the INITIAL obligation node; they still cross all three",
    "top-level IF branches (Forfeiture / ImmediateVesting / maintain-service) and",
    "each `expectedReference` was captured live from jl4-service (deploy + evaluate,",
    "trace=none, with prelude/daydate/date-compat bundled).",
    "A complete future fix must ADD fielded-action fulfilled/breach/order-sensitive",
    "sequences once gap (2) + the jl4-service action encoding both land."
  ],
  "Eligible-Service-Requirement": [
    {
      "__branch": "maintain-service (Termination NOTHING, in eligible service, before performance end) -> MUST maintain, LEST forfeit",
      "expectedReference": {"OBLIGATION": {"action": "`maintain eligible service status` `Service Status`", "deadline": "`Date to days` OF (`Performance End Date` MINUS (`award state`'s `Current Date`))", "modal": "MUST", "party": "`Elon Musk`"}},
      "arguments": {
        "award state": {
          "Musk Service Status": "Chief Executive Officer",
          "Current Date": "2025-09-03",
          "Performance Metrics": {"Current Market Cap": 3000000000000, "Six Month Avg Market Cap": 2800000000000, "Thirty Day Avg Market Cap": 2900000000000, "One Year Avg Market Cap": 2700000000000, "Tesla Vehicles Delivered": 25000000, "Active FSD Subscriptions": 12000000, "Bots Delivered": 1800000, "Robotaxis In Operation": 1100000, "Current Adjusted EBITDA": 60000000000, "Outstanding Shares": 3000000000, "Last Closing Price": 400, "Per Share Consideration": 450},
          "Earned Tranches": [], "Earned Dates": [], "CEO Succession Framework": true,
          "Termination Reason": null, "Covered Event Occurred": false, "Covered Event Type": null,
          "HSR Waiting Period Expired": true, "Shareholder Approval Received": true
        }
      },
      "startTime": 0,
      "events": []
    },
    {
      "__branch": "immediate-vesting via Without Cause -> MAY vest immediately (no deadline)",
      "expectedReference": {"OBLIGATION": {"action": "`vest immediately` EXACTLY `Immediate Vesting Reason` OF `award state`", "deadline": null, "modal": "MAY", "party": "`Elon Musk`"}},
      "arguments": {
        "award state": {
          "Musk Service Status": "Not In Eligible Service",
          "Current Date": "2027-09-03",
          "Performance Metrics": {"Current Market Cap": 3000000000000, "Six Month Avg Market Cap": 2800000000000, "Thirty Day Avg Market Cap": 2900000000000, "One Year Avg Market Cap": 2700000000000, "Tesla Vehicles Delivered": 25000000, "Active FSD Subscriptions": 12000000, "Bots Delivered": 1800000, "Robotaxis In Operation": 1100000, "Current Adjusted EBITDA": 60000000000, "Outstanding Shares": 3000000000, "Last Closing Price": 400, "Per Share Consideration": 450},
          "Earned Tranches": [], "Earned Dates": [], "CEO Succession Framework": true,
          "Termination Reason": "Without Cause", "Covered Event Occurred": false, "Covered Event Type": null,
          "HSR Waiting Period Expired": true, "Shareholder Approval Received": true
        }
      },
      "startTime": 0,
      "events": []
    },
    {
      "__branch": "immediate-vesting via Change In Control -> MAY vest immediately (order note: Forfeiture is checked BEFORE ImmediateVesting; a Change-In-Control state is NOT a forfeiture so it falls to the MAY branch)",
      "expectedReference": {"OBLIGATION": {"action": "`vest immediately` EXACTLY `Immediate Vesting Reason` OF `award state`", "deadline": null, "modal": "MAY", "party": "`Elon Musk`"}},
      "arguments": {
        "award state": {
          "Musk Service Status": "Chief Executive Officer",
          "Current Date": "2027-09-03",
          "Performance Metrics": {"Current Market Cap": 3000000000000, "Six Month Avg Market Cap": 2800000000000, "Thirty Day Avg Market Cap": 2900000000000, "One Year Avg Market Cap": 2700000000000, "Tesla Vehicles Delivered": 25000000, "Active FSD Subscriptions": 12000000, "Bots Delivered": 1800000, "Robotaxis In Operation": 1100000, "Current Adjusted EBITDA": 60000000000, "Outstanding Shares": 3000000000, "Last Closing Price": 400, "Per Share Consideration": 450},
          "Earned Tranches": [], "Earned Dates": [], "CEO Succession Framework": true,
          "Termination Reason": "Change In Control", "Covered Event Occurred": false, "Covered Event Type": null,
          "HSR Waiting Period Expired": true, "Shareholder Approval Received": true
        }
      },
      "startTime": 0,
      "events": []
    },
    {
